  "title": "No-Bean Low-Carb Chili",
  "description": "This no-bean low-carb chili features canned tomatoes, jalapeños, spicy seasonings, and lean ground beef for an easy dinner made in the slow cooker.",
  "authors": [
    "abrown604"
  ],
